@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Refuse a change to the audit log
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "Any operator, including Admin" as actor
box "Frontend — Sweet Hand web application" #E0F2FE
  participant "AuditLogClient" as client
end box
box "Backend — Sweet Hand API application" #D1FADF
  participant "RequestPipeline" as pipeline
  participant "AuditLogEndpoints" as endpoints
end box
box "Backend — Sweet Hand Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  database "Sweet Hand database" as db
end box
actor -> client : Attempt to edit or delete an entry
client -> pipeline : PUT, PATCH or DELETE /operator/audit-log/{id}
pipeline -> endpoints : Route lookup
endpoints --> pipeline : No such route
pipeline --> client : 404 or 405; no state changes (L2-060 AC2)
note over db : Defence in depth: the application database account\nholds INSERT and SELECT only on the audit table;\nany UPDATE or DELETE is refused by the database (L2-060 AC2)
@enduml
